      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Current state - 2026-10-15 | subject to change - in development\nRadius recipes deploy native resources; no agent lifecycle operator, reconciliation API or Foundry management emulator.\nLocal identity uses Keycloak; optional declared Entra identity is additive. Source tests are not live deployment evidence.",
