      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Boundaries: native foreground text Responses only; stored, reference, child and background operations are denied.\nRetention: identities, captures and state have separate ownership; no automatic pruning, credential regeneration or release fallback.\nPortability: hosted agents require identical image digests; prompt agents require native kind and definition parity, not an identical container.\nQualification: GPU / Foundry model inference has documented live evidence; Foundry agent hosting and cloud A365 ingestion remain unqualified.\nNo existing-operator ownership handover is qualified. Setup downloads need connectivity; this is not a fully offline installation claim.\nCurrent basis: native Radius agent guide and AI / Radius capability summary. Endpoint/session compatibility work is deferred.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 108.5,
      "containerId": "legend",
      "originalText": "Boundaries: native foreground text Responses only; stored, reference, child and background operations are denied.\nRetention: identities, captures and state have separate ownership; no automatic pruning, credential regeneration or release fallback.\nPortability: hosted agents require identical image digests; prompt agents require native kind and definition parity, not an identical container.\nQualification: GPU / Foundry model inference has documented live evidence; Foundry agent hosting and cloud A365 ingestion remain unqualified.\nNo existing-operator ownership handover is qualified. Setup downloads need connectivity; this is not a fully offline installation claim.\nCurrent basis: native Radius agent guide and AI / Radius capability summary. Endpoint/session compatibility work is deferred.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
